- Ingat saja...

00:40:39.383 --> 00:40:40.924
Kepala.

00:40:40.925 --> 00:40:42.466
Keras.

00:40:42.467 --> 00:40:44.358
Cepat

00:40:45.300 --> 00:40:47.591
Ayo. Kamu bisa, Megan.

00:40:47.592 --> 00:40:49.507
Oke.

00:40:49.508 --> 00:40:51.108
Ayo, Megan.

00:40:53.383 --> 00:40:55.466
- Carter, aku takut.
- CARTER: Kamu bisa!

00:40:55.467 --> 00:40:56.911
Oh!

00:40:57.642 --> 00:40:59.242
Bunuh dia, Megan!

00:41:00.925 --> 00:41:02.132
Ayo, jalang!

00:41:02.133 --> 00:41:03.723
Ah!

00:41:10.633 --> 00:41:12.400
Bagus.

00:41:13.050 --> 00:41:15.067
Aku selalu benci olahraga.

00:41:15.633 --> 00:41:16.841
Guys, di belakang kalian.

00:41:16.842 --> 00:41:18.329
Oh! Anjrit!

00:41:18.858 --> 00:41:20.236
Aku yang urus.

00:41:24.167 --> 00:41:25.414
Sini.

00:41:34.083 --> 00:41:35.799
Bajingan anjrit!

00:41:36.258 --> 00:41:37.316
MEGAN: Cukup.

00:41:37.340 --> 00:41:39.442
Anjrit kamu!

00:41:40.708 --> 00:41:43.058
Sudah mati. Dia sudah mati.

00:41:43.842 --> 00:41:46.317
Sudah mati. Tidak apa-apa.

00:41:47.883 --> 00:41:50.882
Paman Tony
meyerahkan nyawanya untuk kami.

00:41:50.883 --> 00:41:53.025
Aku tidak bisa menyelamatkannya.

00:41:53.842 --> 00:41:56.567
Aku tidak bisa berbuat apa-apa.

00:42:01.717 --> 00:42:04.650
Aku tidak bisa menyelamatkannya.

00:42:27.717 --> 00:42:29.492
Sial.

