kurasa dia digigit. Dia butuh bantuan.

00:45:44.675 --> 00:45:47.692
Tidak apa-apa. Ya, dia butuh bantuan.

00:45:48.758 --> 00:45:50.507
Di mana dia?

00:45:50.508 --> 00:45:53.091
Dia terinfeksi,
dan dia berubah,

00:45:53.092 --> 00:45:54.424
