00:45:54.425 --> 00:45:56.775
Ya Tuhan, kasihanilah!

00:45:57.467 --> 00:45:59.483
Kalian mau ke mana?

00:46:00.175 --> 00:46:01.570
Sanctuary.

00:46:01.570 --> 00:46:03.216
- Benarkah?
- Sialan.

00:46:03.217 --> 00:46:04.882
Kami menuju ke sana.
Kamu bisa ikut kami.

00:46:04.883 --> 00:46:06.257
Tidak, itu bukan ide bagus.

00:46:06.258 --> 00:46:09.067
Kamu tak bisa asal
ninggalin dia di sini.

00:46:10.383 --> 00:46:12.108
Tolong.

00:46:26.258 --> 00:46:28.983
Ada yang mau cerita
tentang diri kalian?

00:46:32.258 --> 00:46:34.775
Tentu. Ya, aku mulai.

00:46:36.925 --> 00:46:39.257
Di belakang sana,
ada Billy.

00:46:39.258 --> 00:46:41.108
Dia anak yang baik.

00:46:41.925 --> 00:46:43.424
Hai.

